OL,3,AWiddecombe suspect charged with
OL,4,Aplanning terror act against Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FKerry was charged in July with the
OL,7,Fmurder of 78-year-old Widdecombe, a
OL,8,Fformer Conservative minister and Reform
OL,9,FUK spokeswoman.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
