OL,3,AMen charged over alleged plot to target
OL,4,AManchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fwith terror offences over an alleged
OL,8,Fplot to target the Jewish community in
OL,9,FManchester ahead of Yom Kippur, Counter
OL,10,FTerrorism Policing has said.
OL,12,FRahman Salehi, 35, and Salam Ahmadyan,
OL,13,F36, are accused of preparing to commit
OL,14,Fan act of terrorism or assisting
OL,15,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,16,Fon or before 20 September.
OL,18,FThe duo were arrested in the Northern
OL,19,FQuarter area of the city, when
OL,20,Fthousands of British Jews were in
OL,21,Fsynagogues.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
