OL,3,AMen charged over alleged plot to target
OL,4,AManchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood said the
OL,7,Fnews two Iranian men have been charged
OL,8,Fover an alleged plot in the Manchester
OL,9,Farea would be "deeply distressing" to
OL,10,Fthe Jewish community and added "both
OL,11,Fsuspects arrived by small boat several
OL,12,Fyears ago".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
