OL,3,ADaniel Thomas in court accused of
OL,4,Aentering migrant site
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fappeared in court charged with entering
OL,8,Fa restricted zone at a migrant
OL,9,Fprocessing centre in Dover.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo, is accused
OL,13,Fof committing the offence on 31 March,
OL,14,Faccording to court documents.
OL,16,FThomas is further accused of using
OL,17,Fthreatening words or behaviour in the
OL,18,FKent town on 1 April and obstructing a
OL,19,Fperson engaged in a lawful activity on
OL,20,F6 April.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
