OL,3,ARiot police clash with students as
OL,4,Aeducation protests rage in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiot police have clashed with
OL,7,Fprotesters as thousands of students
OL,8,Fdemonstrating over education standards
OL,9,Fdisrupted more than 700 schools in
OL,10,FFrance on Friday.
OL,12,FFires have burned in the streets as
OL,13,Fhigh school pupils and others objected
OL,14,Fto a lack of teachers, overcrowded
OL,15,Fclassrooms and run-down buildings.
OL,17,FThe protests began last week in the
OL,18,Fcapital Paris and have spread across
OL,19,Fthe country, with cities including
OL,20,FMontpellier, Nantes and Marseille
OL,21,Faffected.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
