OL,3,ARiot police clash with students as
OL,4,Aeducation protests rage in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench justice minister Gerald Darmanin
OL,7,Fsaid things had "gone from high-school
OL,8,Fstudent demonstrations to a public
OL,9,Forder disturbance".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
