OL,3,AWoman at centre of Cornell rape inquiry
OL,4,Awas 'failed' by officials, says New
OL,5,AYork governor
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York Governor Kathy Hochul has said
OL,8,Fthe woman at the centre of the Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity rape case was "failed" at
OL,10,F"every turn".
OL,12,FThe woman, known as Jane Doe in legal
OL,13,Fdocuments, alleges she was drugged and
OL,14,Fraped by several men at a fraternity
OL,15,Fhouse in 2024.
OL,17,FThe case was investigated at the time
OL,18,Fbut no charges were laid. It recently
OL,19,Freopened after the woman filed a civil
OL,20,Flawsuit last month that thrust the
OL,21,Fallegations into the national
OL,22,Fspotlight.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
